# Template for packaging/winget/build.sh, which fills in the @...@ fields.
PackageIdentifier: yartat.AchievementCaretaker
PackageVersion: @VERSION@
PackageLocale: en-US
Publisher: Yaroslav V Tatarenko
PublisherUrl: https://github.com/yartat
PublisherSupportUrl: https://github.com/yartat/AchievementCaretaker/issues
PrivacyUrl: https://github.com/yartat/AchievementCaretaker/blob/main/PRIVACY.md
PackageName: Achievement Caretaker
PackageUrl: https://github.com/yartat/AchievementCaretaker
License: MIT and zlib
LicenseUrl: https://github.com/yartat/AchievementCaretaker/blob/main/LICENSE.txt
Copyright: Copyright (c) 2026 Yaroslav V Tatarenko
ShortDescription: View and edit achievements and statistics for Steam, and view the libraries and achievements of Epic Games, GOG and Ubisoft Connect.
Description: |-
  Achievement Caretaker is a desktop tool for the achievements and statistics of your games, from one window.
  Steam: your library with a completion meter per game, and an editor to unlock, lock and reset achievements and edit statistics. Steam must be running and you must be logged in; the library opens without it and shows the games saved last time.
  GOG: your library and achievements; achievements can be unlocked and locked.
  Epic Games: your library and achievements (read-only).
  Ubisoft Connect: your library and achievements, read from the files the launcher keeps on your computer, or from Ubisoft if you sign in; with a sign-in an achievement can be unlocked (not locked again).
  You sign in to GOG, Epic and Ubisoft on the store's own page, inside the application; the application never sees your password. Sign-in tokens are encrypted for your Windows user.
  The installer is per-user and needs no administrator; settings and saved libraries are kept in your user profile when you uninstall.
Tags:
  - achievements
  - epic-games
  - games
  - gog
  - statistics
  - steam
  - ubisoft-connect
ReleaseNotesUrl: https://github.com/yartat/AchievementCaretaker/releases/tag/v@VERSION@
ManifestType: defaultLocale
ManifestVersion: 1.12.0
